description = "You flicker up to {flicker_dist} m forward, stopping short of walls. Your next {n:lightningbolt} within {b:FLICKER_TIME} sec is instant. Using it again within {b:FLICKER_RETURN_TIME} sec snaps you back to where you started, at no cost."
